NOTICE
======

This repository ships only a small curated term base and opt-in, regenerable
lexicon extracts. No proprietary dictionary data is redistributed.

Open English WordNet
--------------------
Source: Open English WordNet 2025 (WN-LMF XML), https://en-word.net/downloads
Project: https://github.com/globalwordnet/english-wordnet
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
         https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Open English WordNet is derived from Princeton WordNet; attribution to the
Global WordNet Association and the original Princeton WordNet authors is
retained in the extracted records. OEWN is an English-only resource: it
provides English terms and has no Arabic translations, so records extracted
from it carry an empty "ar" field.

Wiktionary
----------
Source: Arabic Wiktionary text, extracted by kaikki.org (wiktextract) and
        distributed as JSONL at
        https://kaikki.org/dictionary/Arabic/kaikki.org-dictionary-Arabic.jsonl
License: dual-licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
         International License (CC BY-SA 4.0),
         https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/, and the GNU Free
         Documentation License (GFDL), without invariant sections or cover
         texts, https://www.gnu.org/licenses/fdl-1.3.html
         See https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Wiktionary:Copyrights and
         https://dumps.wikimedia.org/legal.html
Derivative JSONL extracts must retain this attribution and remain under a
compatible licence. The extraction is provided by kaikki.org
(https://kaikki.org/), using the wiktextract tool
(https://github.com/tatuylonen/wikitextprocessor).

Data NOT redistributed
----------------------
Merriam-Webster, Oxford and Collins dictionary data is NOT redistributed by
this repository. Those publishers' terms restrict bulk copying, downloading
and redistribution; their APIs are not used by the downloader and no output
derived from them is committed here. See:
  https://www.merriam-webster.com/i/terms-of-use
  https://languages.oup.com/legal-notice/
  https://www.collinsdictionary.com/terms-and-conditions

Raw downloads are cached outside Git under data/cache/; generated extracts
live under data/dictionaries/ and can be regenerated with:
  python scripts/fetch_lexicon.py --source oewn --limit 100
  python scripts/fetch_lexicon.py --source wiktionary-ar --limit 100
No API key is required.
